'''Dezmin''' "'''Dez'''" '''Lewis''' (born December 5, 1992) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[wide receiver]] for the [[Buffalo Bills]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Central Arkansas Bears football|Central Arkansas Bears]] and was selected by the Bills in the seventh round of the [[2015 NFL draft]].
